  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iran Khodro Co (IKCO) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enable IKCO to annually produce up to 90,000 Peugeot 206 Notchback cars that was designed and engineered in_house by IKCO. This will help IKCO to increase its market share and sales volume at the same time provide it an access to international markets where it will be able to show a strong performance.  The Peugeot 206 Notchback is planned to be manufactured using existing Peugeot 206&apos;s platform. The main components of the project include: &#x2022; Modification of the existing Body Shop, &#x2022; Construction of a new Press Shop with an area of 22000 m2, &#x2022; Modification of the existing Assembly Shop, &#x2022; Construction of a new Paint Shop with a capacity of 50 automobiles per hour, &#x2022; Construction of a body transport area between Paint Shop and the modified Assembly Shop,

&#x2022; Procurement of equipment and machinery for the press shop,

body shop, painting shop and other related accessories. &#x2022; Designing and supervision work, &#x2022; Training of operators tor start up and operation will be arranged by IKCO for a period of 6 months at site during installation and start up.</narrative>
  </description>
